<%--
List_Page_Actions

The page-header buttons of a list page: a New link, and an Export button when the page
passes an $on_export handler. An action hands it to the layout from page_actions():

    page_actions() {
        const can_export = Permission.has_permission(User_Model.PERM_DATA_EXPORT);
        return {
            component: 'List_Page_Actions',
            args: {
                new_href: Rsx.Route('Clients_Edit_Action'),
                on_export: can_export ? () => this.export_all() : null,
            },
        };
    }

$new_href  - where New goes (required)
$new_label - the New link's text (default "New")
$on_export - called when Export is pressed; no Export button when absent
--%>
<Define:List_Page_Actions class="d-flex gap-2" $new_label="New">
    <a href="<%= this.args.new_href %>" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle"></i> <%= this.args.new_label %>
    </a>
    <% if (this.args.on_export) { %>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" @click=this.export_clicked>
            <i class="bi bi-download"></i> Export
        </button>
    <% } %>
</Define:List_Page_Actions>
